    "created_at": "2023-04-24T06:13:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-24T06:13:00Z",
    "body": "Maybe we should instead encourage folks to not use base64 for such cases? I doubt any browser has base64 code paths that take that into account and I'm not sure we should have those.",
