    "updated_at": "2024-04-15T22:28:01Z",
    "body": "The [simdutf library](https://github.com/simdutf/simdutf) (used in Node.js for base64 decoding) implements forgiving base64. As far as we know, it is fully compliant. One issue that I have encountered is that there is no base64url equivalent that is explicit.",
